      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for the request!\n\nWe just released this feature in SDK 3.7.1.\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/releases/release-3-7-1/\n\n@{5e8487f1fd13be66cecc227b|full_name}, does the feature work for you in the final release? Or are you still experiencing issues?",
