      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} The implementation of this as it currently exists in the SDK is not particularly useful. As @{5e8487f1fd13be66cecc227b|full_name} said, the most common way to use this is `Sort<T[]>(T[])` and specifically `Sort<T[]>(T[], Comparison<T>)` which allows us to sort arrays of a specific type by properties of that type.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
